1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,936
Hamburgers, egg pancakes, sizzling noodles

2
00:00:02,936 --> 00:00:05,806
Rice balls, toast, and savory soy milk

3
00:00:05,806 --> 00:00:08,809
There are so many delicious breakfasts
around the world

4
00:00:08,809 --> 00:00:13,347
I'm going to collect them all in my
breakfast truck

5
00:00:13,347 --> 00:00:14,348
And so,

6
00:00:14,348 --> 00:00:15,749
Beelu, who loves breakfast,

7
00:00:15,749 --> 00:00:18,619
set off on an adventure to collect

8
00:00:18,619 --> 00:00:21,021
all kinds of breakfast!

9
00:00:55,656 --> 00:00:58,458
That was fun!

10
00:01:00,127 --> 00:01:02,195
Let's find breakfast!

11
00:01:02,195 --> 00:01:04,798
Good morning, Beelu! Good morning, kids!

12
00:01:04,798 --> 00:01:07,467
Today's breakfast is radish cake

13
00:01:07,467 --> 00:01:09,469
In the adventure story coming up,

14
00:01:09,469 --> 00:01:12,339
there will be three radish cake stickers

15
00:01:12,339 --> 00:01:13,807
Help Beelu

16
00:01:13,807 --> 00:01:16,009
find where they are!

17
00:01:16,009 --> 00:01:18,545
Let's collect today's breakfast!

18
00:01:20,013 --> 00:01:22,950
Circle your left hand, circle your right hand

19
00:01:22,950 --> 00:01:23,617
Baa!

20
00:01:23,617 --> 00:01:24,885
Clap, clap!

21
00:01:24,885 --> 00:01:26,086
Jump up!

22
00:01:26,086 --> 00:01:26,820
Bleh!

23
00:01:26,820 --> 00:01:28,956
Move your left brain, move your right
brain

24
00:01:28,956 --> 00:01:31,892
Yeah! We'll finally get to eat radish
cake!

25
00:01:31,892 --> 00:01:36,163
That's right. We've heard of it, but never
actually tried it.

26
00:01:36,163 --> 00:01:38,231
It's so lively here!

27
00:01:38,231 --> 00:01:41,568
Oh, because Big Head just came back from
down the mountain

28
00:01:41,568 --> 00:01:43,503
after learning how to make radish cake

29
00:01:43,503 --> 00:01:45,572
He's about to make some for all of us

30
00:01:45,572 --> 00:01:48,308
Oh, can I have some too?

31
00:01:48,308 --> 00:01:51,178
I love radish cake!

32
00:01:51,178 --> 00:01:53,647
Of course! You're welcome!

33
00:01:59,586 --> 00:02:01,788
The radish cake is ready!

34
00:02:01,788 --> 00:02:04,725
Wow, this is my first time trying radish
cake!

35
00:02:04,725 --> 00:02:05,792
So radish cake

36
00:02:05,792 --> 00:02:08,996
is just radish with soy paste?

37
00:02:09,863 --> 00:02:12,532
It's so crunchy and salty!

38
00:02:15,068 --> 00:02:17,070
This isn't radish cake!

39
00:02:19,473 --> 00:02:22,476
Real radish cake is square

40
00:02:22,476 --> 00:02:24,878
and soft when you eat it

41
00:02:27,481 --> 00:02:28,615
Really, Big Head?

42
00:02:28,615 --> 00:02:31,685
So what you made isn't real radish cake?

43
00:02:31,685 --> 00:02:33,153
You're a fraud!

44
00:02:33,954 --> 00:02:35,555
This is just an appetizer

45
00:02:35,555 --> 00:02:38,692
I still need to prepare the radish cake

46
00:02:38,692 --> 00:02:40,494
Come inside with me!

47
00:02:43,096 --> 00:02:44,164
Everyone,

48
00:02:44,164 --> 00:02:46,233
come back in an hour

49
00:02:48,769 --> 00:02:49,903
Who are you?

50
00:02:49,903 --> 00:02:51,571
Why are you saying things like that?

51
00:02:51,571 --> 00:02:53,106
I'm Beelu

52
00:02:53,106 --> 00:02:54,574
I'm not saying anything wrong

53
00:02:54,574 --> 00:02:57,177
You're the one tricking everyone with fake
radish cake

54
00:02:57,177 --> 00:03:00,714
I... I just don't want to let everyone
down

55
00:03:02,516 --> 00:03:04,451
Because everyone really wants to know

56
00:03:04,451 --> 00:03:06,787
what radish cake tastes like

57
00:03:06,787 --> 00:03:09,656
So they paid for me to go down the
mountain and learn

58
00:03:10,457 --> 00:03:12,793
But the teacher was so handsome

59
00:03:12,793 --> 00:03:14,327
I didn't pay attention in class

60
00:03:14,327 --> 00:03:16,329
That's why I didn't learn how to make it

61
00:03:19,066 --> 00:03:20,200
I'm going to tell everyone the truth

62
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,268
N-no, don't!

63
00:03:21,268 --> 00:03:22,736
We got a recipe after class

64
00:03:22,736 --> 00:03:26,139
If I follow the recipe, I can make it too!

65
00:03:27,207 --> 00:03:29,409
Then why don't you just follow the recipe?

66
00:03:30,477 --> 00:03:33,480
Because I can't read

67
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:35,949
And nobody in our village can read either

68
00:03:35,949 --> 00:03:39,219
So having a recipe doesn't help us

69
00:03:42,756 --> 00:03:43,824
Big Head,

70
00:03:43,824 --> 00:03:44,758
let me help you

71
00:03:44,758 --> 00:03:45,959
I can read

72
00:03:45,959 --> 00:03:48,161
Really?

73
00:03:48,161 --> 00:03:49,563
Thank you!

74
00:03:52,632 --> 00:03:57,504
Strange. Where did I put the recipe?

75
00:03:57,504 --> 00:03:58,371
Big Head,

76
00:03:58,371 --> 00:04:02,175
can you really make it in an hour?

77
00:04:02,175 --> 00:04:03,310
Y-yes, of course

78
00:04:05,912 --> 00:04:07,047
Baa baa baa baa baa baa!

79
00:04:07,047 --> 00:04:08,982
Ah, you can't eat that!

80
00:04:08,982 --> 00:04:11,518
He's eating the recipe!

81
00:04:13,653 --> 00:04:16,123
Oh, I'm doomed!

82
00:04:16,123 --> 00:04:17,524
What do you mean, doomed?

83
00:04:19,926 --> 00:04:22,996
Beelu, what are we going to do?

84
00:04:22,996 --> 00:04:24,798
I don't know either

85
00:04:24,798 --> 00:04:27,067
Let's do the Breakfast Brain Workout

86
00:04:27,067 --> 00:04:28,468
and think of a solution!

87
00:04:30,070 --> 00:04:33,607
Circle your left hand, circle your right hand

88
00:04:33,607 --> 00:04:35,542
Clap! Clap!

89
00:04:35,542 --> 00:04:37,277
Jump up!

90
00:04:37,277 --> 00:04:40,814
Move your left brain, move your right
brain

91
00:04:40,814 --> 00:04:43,283
Clap! Clap!

92
00:04:43,283 --> 00:04:45,418
Bi Ru Akokay

93
00:04:46,820 --> 00:04:48,288
Look carefully

94
00:04:48,288 --> 00:04:50,290
and see if there's a clue

95
00:04:51,224 --> 00:04:52,492
Oh, could this be

96
00:04:52,492 --> 00:04:55,829
a link to a radish-cake tutorial video?

97
00:04:55,829 --> 00:04:58,498
Big Head, where's the computer in your
house?

98
00:04:58,498 --> 00:04:59,432
A computer?

99
00:04:59,432 --> 00:05:02,169
Our village doesn't have computers

100
00:05:02,169 --> 00:05:05,105
You can only find those at the school down
the mountain

101
00:05:05,105 --> 00:05:06,439
That's so far away!

102
00:05:07,107 --> 00:05:09,309
Then let's take my breakfast truck!

103
00:05:09,309 --> 00:05:10,043
Mm-hmm!

104
00:05:15,382 --> 00:05:18,385
Big Head, is the radish cake ready?

105
00:05:18,385 --> 00:05:19,252
This...

106
00:05:19,252 --> 00:05:20,987
Big Head, there's no time!

107
00:05:20,987 --> 00:05:22,856
I'll explain later

108
00:05:24,991 --> 00:05:27,661
Should we go after him?

109
00:05:27,661 --> 00:05:28,595
Mm-hmm

110
00:05:59,626 --> 00:06:02,562
Beelu, what does it say?

111
00:06:02,562 --> 00:06:03,430
It says...

112
00:06:03,430 --> 00:06:04,898
The internet signal is too weak

113
00:06:04,898 --> 00:06:06,099
The video won't play

114
00:06:06,099 --> 00:06:08,168
What do you mean it won't play?

115
00:06:08,969 --> 00:06:10,704
Why are you all here?

116
00:06:11,771 --> 00:06:13,907
I'm doomed now!

117
00:06:13,907 --> 00:06:15,642
Big Head, don't give up!

118
00:06:15,642 --> 00:06:17,844
Let's do the Breakfast Brain Workout one
more time

119
00:06:17,844 --> 00:06:19,312
and think of a solution!

120
00:06:36,396 --> 00:06:38,131
It's Brain Workout Time!

121
00:06:38,131 --> 00:06:41,868
Circle your left hand, circle your right hand

122
00:06:41,868 --> 00:06:43,670
Clap! Clap!

123
00:06:43,670 --> 00:06:45,538
Jump up!

124
00:06:45,538 --> 00:06:49,276
Move your left brain, move your right
brain

125
00:06:49,276 --> 00:06:51,077
Clap! Clap!

126
00:06:51,077 --> 00:06:53,013
Jump up!

127
00:06:53,013 --> 00:06:56,616
Make a sun with your hands and say good
morning

128
00:06:56,616 --> 00:06:58,885
Clap! Clap!

129
00:06:58,885 --> 00:07:00,687
Bi Ru Akokay

130
00:07:03,223 --> 00:07:06,026
Big Head, I've got a great idea!

131
00:07:07,894 --> 00:07:08,962
Excuse me

132
00:07:08,962 --> 00:07:11,031
Can I borrow this?

133
00:07:11,031 --> 00:07:13,833
And this, and this, and this!

134
00:07:13,833 --> 00:07:15,635
Lend me all your antlers!

135
00:07:16,836 --> 00:07:18,305
I need a little more

136
00:07:18,305 --> 00:07:21,508
More, more, more!

137
00:07:22,108 --> 00:07:24,577
The super antenna is ready!

138
00:07:36,189 --> 00:07:36,856
Hello, everyone!

139
00:07:36,856 --> 00:07:38,058
Welcome to The Deer Chef!

140
00:07:38,058 --> 00:07:39,726
Oh, we've got internet!

141
00:07:39,726 --> 00:07:41,461
Oh, Teacher!

142
00:07:41,461 --> 00:07:43,396
Everyone, remember to take notes!

143
00:07:43,396 --> 00:07:46,266
No, I have to concentrate! Concentrate!

144
00:07:46,266 --> 00:07:47,334
Big Head,

145
00:07:47,334 --> 00:07:50,603
didn't you already learn how to make
radish cake?

146
00:07:50,603 --> 00:07:52,405
Well, this is...

147
00:07:52,405 --> 00:07:54,607
It's just a review!

148
00:07:54,607 --> 00:07:56,743
Right, right, right! A review!

149
00:08:01,348 --> 00:08:03,683
That's all for today's radish cake lesson

150
00:08:03,683 --> 00:08:07,420
Wow, so this is real radish cake!

151
00:08:07,420 --> 00:08:09,556
All right, let's hurry back

152
00:08:13,493 --> 00:08:15,562
Okay, here we go!

153
00:08:26,706 --> 00:08:28,241
It's done!

154
00:08:28,241 --> 00:08:29,576
Radish cake!

155
00:08:31,378 --> 00:08:33,847
Oh, is this radish cake?

156
00:08:36,316 --> 00:08:38,451
It's so soft and delicious!

157
00:08:41,187 --> 00:08:44,324
Sending Big Head down the mountain to
learn was the right choice

158
00:08:45,925 --> 00:08:47,927
So tasty! So tasty!

159
00:08:50,530 --> 00:08:53,333
Big Head, your radish cake is really
delicious!

160
00:08:54,467 --> 00:08:57,203
Beelu, thank you

161
00:08:57,203 --> 00:08:58,738
Don't thank me

162
00:08:58,738 --> 00:09:00,940
We made it together

163
00:09:03,343 --> 00:09:04,544
Hey, Big Head!

164
00:09:04,544 --> 00:09:05,612
Is there any more radish cake?

165
00:09:05,612 --> 00:09:07,480
I'd like another plate

166
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,681
Coming right up!

167
00:09:10,417 --> 00:09:12,752
That was fun!

168
00:09:14,087 --> 00:09:15,555
Baa!

169
00:09:23,830 --> 00:09:25,698
Let's find breakfast!

170
00:09:25,698 --> 00:09:27,634
Here are the answers!

171
00:09:27,634 --> 00:09:29,969
Today's breakfast stickers are in these
places

172
00:09:34,107 --> 00:09:35,708
Did you find them?

173
00:09:38,778 --> 00:09:41,247
Yeah, I knew it!

174
00:09:43,049 --> 00:09:45,452
How do you make delicious radish cake?

175
00:09:45,452 --> 00:09:47,921
First, shred the white radish

176
00:09:49,589 --> 00:09:52,992
Stir-fry it with the seasonings until soft

177
00:09:52,992 --> 00:09:55,395
Add a batter made from rice flour

178
00:09:56,529 --> 00:09:58,131
Pour it into a mold

179
00:09:58,131 --> 00:09:59,532
Steam until cooked

180
00:09:59,532 --> 00:10:01,468
Let it cool, and it's radish cake!

181
00:10:02,469 --> 00:10:03,937
Radish cakes from different breakfast
shops

182
00:10:03,937 --> 00:10:05,538
look different

183
00:10:05,538 --> 00:10:06,873
because they're made in different ways

184
00:10:06,873 --> 00:10:09,742
But if you cut the radish cake into small
pieces

185
00:10:09,742 --> 00:10:11,678
and fry them in hot oil,

186
00:10:14,481 --> 00:10:17,417
you can make the most delicious radish
cake breakfast!

187
00:10:18,952 --> 00:10:21,688
Wow, it looks delicious!

188
00:10:26,493 --> 00:10:30,163
Big Head, your radish cake is really
delicious!

189
00:10:31,431 --> 00:10:33,166
You're too kind!

190
00:10:33,166 --> 00:10:33,833
But...

191
00:10:33,833 --> 00:10:35,835
White radish is so hard

192
00:10:35,835 --> 00:10:39,906
Why does it become soft when it's made
into radish cake?

193
00:10:39,906 --> 00:10:41,508
Well, that's because...

194
00:10:41,508 --> 00:10:44,644
When cooking, the white radish is shredded
very finely

195
00:10:44,644 --> 00:10:45,979
and cooked

196
00:10:45,979 --> 00:10:47,847
Then indica rice flour is added

197
00:10:47,847 --> 00:10:49,983
which makes it soft

198
00:10:49,983 --> 00:10:51,384
Rice flour?

199
00:10:52,118 --> 00:10:55,455
Rice flour is made by grinding non-glutinous rice

200
00:10:55,455 --> 00:10:56,856
Besides radish cake,

201
00:10:56,856 --> 00:10:59,592
many foods use rice flour too

202
00:11:00,593 --> 00:11:02,795
White radish and rice flour

203
00:11:02,795 --> 00:11:05,265
become radish cake after steaming

204
00:11:06,199 --> 00:11:09,536
Shallots and shiitake mushrooms mixed with rice flour

205
00:11:09,602 --> 00:11:10,470
and steamed

206
00:11:10,470 --> 00:11:14,274
become savory steamed rice cakes often offered at temples

207
00:11:14,274 --> 00:11:17,677
And wheat flour, baking powder, and rice flour

208
00:11:17,677 --> 00:11:21,881
become prosperity cakes traditionally eaten at Lunar New Year when steamed

209
00:11:21,881 --> 00:11:22,882
And there's more!

210
00:11:22,882 --> 00:11:24,951
The red and white tangyuan eaten at the
Winter Solstice

211
00:11:24,951 --> 00:11:28,688
are made with glutinous rice flour and regular rice flour

212
00:11:28,688 --> 00:11:30,423
I never knew rice flour

213
00:11:30,423 --> 00:11:33,226
could be used to make so many different
foods

214
00:11:33,226 --> 00:11:35,228
Big Head, you know so much!

215
00:11:35,228 --> 00:11:38,965
No, I have a good teacher

216
00:11:38,965 --> 00:11:41,501
Big Head, once you learn to read,

217
00:11:41,501 --> 00:11:44,437
you can use a computer to look up any
recipe

218
00:11:44,437 --> 00:11:46,506
and make lots of different foods!

219
00:11:46,506 --> 00:11:48,908
All right! Then I'll learn to read!
